// If the nameAlg is TPM_ALG_NULL, the TPM cannot, and thus shall not verify the
// integrity HMAC on the sensitive area. The TPM will still perform
// cryptographic validity checks (e.g., the ECC public point is on the curve)
// and public/private keypair consistency checks.
